    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2023_0108","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Tenzin Dubois-Ngata talks about a portrait of the wind, from behind. Recorded while the artist repainted the studio wall the same white, four times.</Description>
